Scope	In-scope DER interconnection sites (≥500 kW) that have reached construction complete and are awaiting utility-owned RTU and/or POI recloser to permit energization under TCS-02 §5. Standing register — no date prefix; refreshed weekly.					
Companion report	2025-06_Supplier_Lead_Time_Report.xlsx (Marcus Deele, SCADA/EMS Engineering)					
Column note	"Requested Priority" reflects customer- or stakeholder-stated priority claims as received in writing; entries are transcribed verbatim from the requesting party's correspondence.					
